#!/bin/bash
# generates the remaining reference images in parallel (girl_sheet.png must exist)
cd /hutian/repo
S="soft gouache and watercolour storybook illustration, 19th-century Danish fairy-tale picture book, visible paper grain and dry-brush texture, painterly, not photoreal, not 3D, not anime, no text, no lettering, no watermark."
GR="Keep the girl EXACTLY as in the reference sheet (same face, long fair curls, bareheaded, patched brown-grey dress, blue checked apron knotted at the corners, dark-grey shawl on shoulders only, bare feet)."
COR="a snowy nook where two 1840s Danish house fronts meet: the LEFT ochre-stucco house stands further out toward the viewer with a closed shuttered door, the RIGHT rust-grey stucco house is set back; the back wall of the nook is rough cracked wet-stone grey plaster with scrape marks and a darker stained patch, a worn stone step, snow drifted in the angle, a dark closed window above"
g(){ python3 tools/gen.py "$@" || python3 tools/gen.py "$@"; }
g refs/girl_faces.png "Close-up study sheet on plain warm-grey paper: the girl from the reference, shown as (1) face front, (2) face three-quarter with snow in her hair, (3) a small tearful face, (4) a small peaceful smile with eyes closed, rosy cheeks, (5) her two numb red hands striking a match, (6) her two bare red-blue feet in snow. $GR $S" refs/girl_sheet.png &
g refs/grandmother_sheet.png "Character model sheet on plain warm-grey paper: a small old grandmother, kind lined face, gentle smile, warm grey-blue eyes, white hair under a plain white linen cap, soft lilac-grey long dress with white collar, dark plum shawl over her shoulders; shown front view, three-quarter view and a glowing white-gold version with a soft golden halo. Same painted style as the reference girl sheet. $S" refs/girl_sheet.png &
g refs/corner_wide.png "Wide establishing view of THE CORNER at night in cold indigo and slate-blue light with falling snow, no people: $COR. $S" &
g refs/corner_over_shoulder.png "View from just behind and above the shoulder of the girl (from the reference sheet, seen from behind: fair curls, dark-grey shawl) sitting on the stone step hugging her knees, looking at the back wall of the corner nook with a tiny warm amber match flame lighting the wall: $COR. $GR cold indigo night, warm amber light only from the match. $S" refs/girl_sheet.png &
g refs/corner_dawn.png "The same corner nook at DAWN, pale grey-blue and faint rose light, deep snow, burnt black matches scattered in the snow, no people: $COR. $S" &
g refs/street_dusk.png "Wide high-angle view of a narrow cobbled Danish town street at dusk, 1840s, snow falling and lying on cobbles, tall narrow gabled houses in ochre, rust and grey stucco, small-paned windows lit by candles, dark-indigo sky, nearly dark, a tiny figure of a girl far down the street. Cold indigo, slate blue and snow white with small warm window accents. $S" &
wait
g refs/style_frame.png "STYLE FRAME: the girl from the reference sitting in the cold corner nook against the cracked wet-stone wall, striking a match; warm amber glow pushes the cold indigo blue back; falling snow. $GR Reference for the corner: refs/corner_wide. $S" refs/girl_sheet.png refs/corner_wide.png &
g refs/vision_stove.png "The girl (reference) sitting in the corner nook (reference), a big black cast-iron stove with polished brass feet and brass ornament lid glowing orange appears before her; she stretches out her bare feet to it; warm amber and gold light, deep warm shadows, cold blue only at the edges. $GR $S" refs/girl_sheet.png refs/corner_wide.png &
g refs/vision_goose.png "The corner nook's cracked back wall turning transparent like a veil; through it a warm room: snow-white tablecloth, fine blue-and-white porcelain, candles, a steaming roast goose stuffed with apples and prunes, a knife and fork stuck in its back, the goose hopping off the dish and waddling, whimsical. Over the shoulder of the girl (reference, from behind) in the cold foreground. amber and gold. $GR $S" refs/girl_sheet.png refs/corner_wide.png &
g refs/vision_tree.png "Seen from behind and below the girl (reference), an enormous dark-green Christmas fir filling the frame with thousands of small candles and hanging coloured paper pictures and ornaments in red, blue and gold; she reaches up; candle lights rising into the night sky as stars, one star falling with a long trail of fire. Warm amber and gold. $GR $S" refs/girl_sheet.png &
g refs/vision_grandmother.png "The grandmother (reference sheet) radiant white-gold, standing in light before the cracked stone wall of the corner nook, holding out her arms lovingly to the girl (other reference) who reaches to her with tears. Cream-white and gold glow, cold blue only at the extreme edges. Keep both faces and clothes exactly as in the references. $S" refs/grandmother_sheet.png refs/girl_sheet.png &
wait
g refs/ascent.png "Wide view high above the snowy rooftops of an 1840s gabled Danish town: the radiant white-gold grandmother (reference) carries the girl (reference, bare feet, fair curls, blue apron) in her arms, both flying upward in light and joy into a luminous cream-gold sky, the small cold blue town far below. $S" refs/grandmother_sheet.png refs/girl_sheet.png &
g refs/dawn_girl.png "DAWN in the corner nook (reference): the girl (reference) sits leaning against the cracked wall, snow on her hair and shoulders, eyes closed, rosy cheeks, a small peaceful smile, burnt black matches in the snow beside her, still and gentle, not graphic, no blue lips. Pale grey-blue and faint rose light. $GR $S" refs/girl_sheet.png refs/corner_dawn.png &
g refs/cast_boy_passers.png "Cast sheet on plain warm-grey paper: (1) a ragged laughing boy of about 10 with an oversized dark cap and patched brown jacket, holding one oversized worn brown slipper; (2) a hurrying 1840s gentleman in a long dark coat and top hat; (3) a lady in a bonnet with a fur muffler; (4) a gentle woman in a dove-grey bonnet and dark-green coat (the morning speaker); (5) a man in a top hat in muted pale light. Faces muted. $S" &
g refs/props_sheet.png "Prop sheet on plain warm-grey paper: a bundle of thin wooden matches with red-brown heads tied with twine; a single match burning with a small warm amber flame; several burnt black matches; a pair of three-sizes-too-big cracked brown adult slippers; the knotted blue checked apron full of matches; a big black cast-iron stove with polished brass feet and brass lid ornament; a black horse-drawn 1840s carriage with lit lantern and dark horses. $S" &
wait
ls refs
